text:
Heard my first Chiffchaff singing today in #Devon
Guessing it could be one that has over wintered here as it is about 10 days earlier than normal for me. Lovely to hear though, a real sign of the Spring to come.
@iand777.bsky.social @alexanderlees.bsky.social @markavery.bsky.social #ukbirds #birds 🪶
